# storage-api / obj-gateway core rules

- Go 1.25 gateway in `packages/gateway`; module path `github.com/SolaTyolo/storage-api`.
- Presigned-URL only: never proxy object PUT/GET bodies through the gateway.
- No PostgreSQL / metadata DB; use `x-amz-meta-*` + HeadObject.
- Adapter: `internal/adapter.ObjectAdapter` via registry (minio-go).
- Docker playground uses RustFS; set `publicEndpoint` for browser presign URLs.
- English only in code comments and docs; Chinese only in `README.zh-CN.md`.
- Go backend SDK: `packages/go-sdk` (presign + direct object I/O; same model as TS SDK).
- Verify: `cd packages/gateway && go build ./cmd/gateway && go test ./...`, `cd packages/go-sdk && go test ./...`, and `cd packages/sdk && npm test && npm run build`.
- See [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).
